<title>UK: British Land placing 42.8 mln new shares.</title>
<headline>British Land placing 42.8 mln new shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Land Plc said on Thursday it was placing 42.8 million new shares at 520p.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>The stock was down 1-1/2p at 540-1/2 by 1050 GMT in volume of 542,285 shares.</p>
</text>
